		Title = "July 2023 -  Balance Patch",
		Subtitle = "Announcing changes to Toys and Celestials.",
		Date = "July 28, 2023",
		Card = "Broken Dreams",
		["Patch Notes"] = { {
			Text = "<b>Community Changes</b><br/>\t<i>By the community, for the community.</i><br/>\t\n\t\t<i>The following changes have been made due to player feedback.</i><br/>\n<br/>Xenoslime: Now ⚪🟢🟢🟢🟢🟢🟢🟡 (+🟢)\n<br/>Necroforensics Corporation: Now ⚪⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡 (-🔵🟡).\n<br/>Unshackled Mind: Now 700/500 (-300/-200)\n<br/>Iun_r: Each card given now costs 1 less of each type of stud.\n<br/>Dairing of the Rift: Now ⚪🟢🟢🟢🟢🟢 (-⚪)\n<br/>Emilvita: Now 50/450 (-50/+50)\n<br/>Broken Supercomputer: Now triggers when it dies (From when cast)\n<br/>MinePix110: Now 1200/400 (-0/-100)\n<br/>Player: Now gives 200 Power when it dies (from 100)\n<br/>Ego Culling: Now ⚪⚪🟢🟢🟢🟢🟢 (+🟢)\n<br/>DevRolve: The clone summoned by DevRolve now has its current stats.\n<br/>Redcliff Archer:\tInstead of dealing 150 damage per trigger, now deals 100 damage, then destroys the target if it has 50 or less health.\n<br/>BrandonOccult: Now ⚪🟡🟡🟡🟡 (+⚪). Effect now \"Whenever an allied fighter targets, if effects have targeted once or twice this turn: You draw a card, except it\"s fleeting.\"\n\t\n<b>Executive Changes</b><br/>\t<i>From Myrmiredon, head of the ACGD</i><br/>\t\n\t\t<i>The following changes are from the head designer.</i><br/>\n\n<b>Celestials</b><br/>\t<i>Total group rework</i><br/>\t\n\t\t<i>This group has been a significant design nightmare. Designed for splexit, this group needing huge life totals makes games take a long time and create linear, binary gamestates; Either they have the huge life and win, or got Aggro\"d T3 and lose. We would like to print powerful lifegain cards, such as melvin, without worrying if that upset the balance of this group as fixed life requirements are entirely dependent on how easily reachable they are. Thus, the Celestial group has been reworked in order to open up design space in GB.</i><br/>\n\n\n<br/>Celestial Remnant: Reworked. Now ⚪ 1000/100. Effect now \"Overload. Whenever this card attacks: Until your next end step, it gains power equal to the amount of life you\"ve gained this turn.\"\n<br/>Celestial of Sun: Now ⚪⚪ (-🟢). Now gives a fixed 100 depower when cast. No longer generates when cast.\n<br/>Celestial of Moon: Now ⚪⚪ (-🔵). No longer generates when cast.\n<br/>Celestials of Time and Space: Reworked. Now 🟢🔵🔵🔵. \"If you have more than 6000 life, you lose that much life and draw four cards. Otherwise, you gain 1000 life. Give yourself a Celestial Remnant.\"\n<br/>Celestials of Life and Death: Reworked. Now 🟢🟢🟢🔵. \"You gain 300 life. A target enemy fighter loses power equal to the amount of life you\"ve gained this turn. Give yourself a Celestial Remnant.\"\n<br/>Celestials of Chaos and Fate: No longer gives life. Rather than losing its colourless cost if you have a set amount of life, now loses it if you have gained 1000 or more life.\n<br/>Celestials of Night and Day: Instead of its requirement needing a fixed life total, now requires 10 Celestials in your Graveyard to be cast. Now 🟢🟢🟢🟢🔵🔵🔵🔵 (+🟢🔵). Now gains 2000 life (From 500)\n\n<b>Toys</b><br/>\t<i>Total group rework</i><br/>\t\n\t\t<i>I\"ll be blunt: Toys are a splexit design that was incredibly lame. They were so lame that no one played them for over two years since their last iteration, which is a problem when that iteration was trivially overpowered. This complete overhaul removes the Splexity rot from this group.</i><br/>\n\n<br/>Toy Truck: Reworked. Now ⚪⚪ 400/400. \"Whenever you cast a Toy: Lock this card for 1 turn. Then if it has 5 or more locks, unlock it and recur an allied Toy card.\"\n<br/>Toy Teeth: Reworked. Now ⚪⚪ 900/100. \"Whenever you cast a Toy: Lock this card for 1 turn. Then if it has 5 or more locks, unlock it and you gain two colourless studs.\"\n<br/>Toy Car: \"Now ⚪🟡🟡 350/350. Whenever you cast a Toy: Lock this card for 1 turn. Then if it has 5 or more locks, unlock it and a target fighter.\"\n<br/>Toy Remote: Reworked. Now ⚪. \"Lock a target allied figher for 1 turn. It gains 100 Power for each lock it has, but can\"t gain more than 500 Power this way.\"\n<br/>Toy Jet Fighter: Reworked. Now 🟡🟡🟡 500/500. \"Whenever you cast an action: Lock this card and a target allied fighter for 1 turn. Then if this card has 5 or more locks, unlock it and all allied fighters gain 100 Health and Power.\"\n<br/>Toy Plane: Reworked. Now ⚪🟡🟡🟡🟡 600/400. \"Haste. Whenever a fighter dies: Lock this card for 1 turn. Then if it has 5 or more locks, unlock it and draw a card.\"\n<br/>Call of the Teddy Bear: Reworked. Now 5🟡. \"Fading. Recur all allied Toy cards. Destroy them if they\"re not cast by their next end step.\"\n<br/>Toy Boss Dino: Reworked. Now 6🟡 1500/1500. \"This card can\"t counter. Whenever you cast a Toy: Lock this card for 1 turn. Then if it has 8 or more locks, unlock it and steal a target enemy fighter.\"\n<br/>Toy Train: Now 250/250 (+100/+100). Now buffs by 100/100 (from 200/200) per trigger.\n\n<b>Miscellaneous Changes</b><br/>\t<i>It\"s funny tho</i><br/>\t\n\t\t<i>The following changes have been made to improve the balance of the game.</i><br/>\n\n<br/>Dominus Frigidus: Reworked. Now 7🔵 700/600. \"When this card is cast: Draw a card.\"\n<br/>Dominus Infernus: Reworked. Now 7🔴 1000/700 with Overload.\n<br/>Dominus Aureus:\tReworked. Now 7🟡 800/500. \"Whenever this card attacks: All allied fighters gain 100 Power.\"\n<br/>Dominus Praefectus: Reworked. Now 7🟢 600/600. \"When this card is cast: It deals 600 damage to a target fighter. You gain 600 life.\"\n<br/>Ultimate Doregriffon: Instead of summoning a clone, now gives you two colourless fighter cards.\nJuan2184: Now statted 500/500 (+0/+100)\n<br/>Mydadisaguest: Reworked. Now ⚪⚪⚪⚪ 400/400. \"When this card is cast: Select a card in your hand. Remove a Green stud from it, or four if you\"ve ever cast a fighter onto a full board this game.\"\n<br/>Quf3y: Now ⚪⚪🟡🟡🟡 600/500. Effect now only triggers once (like Loogi), and only on allied fighters.\n<br/>Iris, Stargazer: Now immune to effect damage. Now deals 4000 damage instead of destroying when cast.\nUmwelt Shift: Now ⚪⚪🔴🔴🔵🔵 (-⚪)\n<br/>Skull Collector\"s Ritual: Now 8⚪ (+6⚪). Ritual Parts you cast reduce this cost by ⚪ each time they\"re cast. Now gives1000 life when cast.\n<br/> Yourei Fox: Reworked. Now 🟢🟢🟡🟡 (-⚪) 700/200 (-0-150). \"Whenever you cast a Yourei fighter, if your opponent has 3 or more cards in their graveyard: Obliterate 3 cards in their graveyard, then that Yourei gains 50 Power for each card in there.\"\n<br/>Yourei Meat: Now 100/350 (+0/+250)\n<br/>Ultras:\tNow inert in all zones.\n<br/>Ultra Beseecher: Instead of locking a fighter, now draws a card.\n<br/>Ultra Desirer: Now buffs only allied Ultras.\n<br/>Ultra Annihilator: Now has Overload, now OmniImmune.\n<br/>Absolute Confrontation: Now rank 7. No longer deals 13000 damage to all fighters.\n<br/>Eclipse, Werewolf Colossus: Now has Overload. Now immune to effect damage. No longer immune to effect destruction.\n<br/>1337: Now has Overload."
		} }
