			Text = "For more information and updates, join the community server.\n\nThe following changes have been made due to player feedback.\nSharpTH: Now 400/400 (+50/+50)\nNovice Arkhivist: Now 400/400 (+50/+50)\nDiscovery of Rebirth: Enzyme vials given by it now cost ⚪⚪ (+⚪)\nForothian Moongeist: Now 200/400 (+0/+200)\nForothian Blessed Gem: Now draws a card and applies an Eldritch Blessing, rather than applying two.\nSanction of Cowardice: Now 1000/600 (+500/+0). Now returnimmune.\nSolomon, the Phoenix Whisperer: Now ⚪⚪⚪🟡🟡🟡🟡🟡🟡🟡🟡 (-⚪⚪+🟡🟡🟡). Now lets you select the card to summon.\nFarseeker Trainee: Now ⚪🔵🔵🔵 (+🔵🔵-⚪).\nToy Train: Now only gives power.\nCall of the Teddy Bear: Now recurs four cards (from all)\nSlumbering Colossus: Now 1000/300 (+0/+250)\nDigitalMessiah: Now 400/400 (+50/+50)\nMorgue Merchant: No longer powerbuffs. Now 300/300 (+100/+100)\nCounsel Engine: Now 600/600 (+0/+100)\nGrey, Mending the Lost: Now gives 100 Power if you're not in Bliss, then 400 additional power if you're in Bliss (From 500 only in bliss)\nFl00fy_Bonez: Can now only target allied fighters.\nAnimal Experimentation Kit: Now only gives 200 Health/Power. Now 650/650 (+50/+50)\nBlockerwiz: Now 500/600 (+-50/+50)\nRapport: Now {W}{R}🟡🟡🟡🟡 (+🟡🟡🟡)\n\nThe following changes have been made by Myrmiredon, head of the ACGD, to improve gameplay.\nDissing Dissident: In addition to its other effects, now destroys the bottom two cards of your deck when cast.\nWorldpurge: Now rank 20. Now 10🔴,10🟢. Now only affects your opponent.\nCosmic Studs: Now costs nothing. (-⚪)\nSerene End: Now rank 8. Now also prevents any other cards from being cast for the rest of the turn.\nForbidden Power: Now rank 6.\nPublic Immortality House: Now 🔴🔴🔴🔵🔵🔵 (+🔴🔵)\nCatlyn Nyaxon, Hunter: Now 1200/1000 (+200/+0); Now triggers on any death (from only allies)\nCaitlin Nixon, Hunted: Now ⚪🟢🔵 (-⚪)\nBabylon Piler: Now also gives a colourless stud if it dies to an allied effect.\nVetexGames: Now ⚪⚪🔵🔵🔵🔵🔵 (-⚪)\nBlizaki: Now 2500/50 (+0/+50)\nHaydebug2003: Now has overload.\nTitanic Coalescence: Now ⚪⚪🟢🟢 (-⚪)\nPikucho_de: Now Rank 7. Now ⚪⚪⚪⚪⚪ (-⚪⚪⚪)\nNewbie: Now 650/50 (-250/-0)\nNecroenzyme Vials: Now ⚪⚪⚪⚪ (+⚪). (Specific cards still change their cost.)\nFederation Stratagem Abduction: Now gives 3 Moonleaks (from 4)\n\nThe following changes are miscellaneous QoL updates.\nThe Enzyme Expunged: Now obliterates itself when cast. Now obliterates the entire baseplate, then puts two Colourless studs in there.\nMeeboid Cultist: Now {G} (-{G}). Now 450/150 (-150/-50)\nConsult the Archives: No longer requires no actions to be cast.\nExcited Bouncer: Now zombified, instead of fading.\n\nMany improvements to the game's code have been made this year. Each major update, we will be updating one pack to be up to date. This patch is Ultimate Power. The following mechanically relevant changes have been made as a result.\nGrandmaster's Ninja Dojo: Now has each player draw a card and gain 🔴 during your opponent's end step.\nOne Thousand Deaths: Now properly readies rather than unlocks.\nDukran the Elysian: Now a 1200/300 fighter with the effect \"When this card is cast: Give yourself Splintered Genesis and recur four Alar action cards. During your end step: Summon an Alar Herald or an Alar Trainee.\"\nSplintered Genesis: Now obliterates itself when cast.\nThebenster: After triggering its ability and summoning a clone, the clone can now trigger its ability on the same turn independently of the first card.\nDeathETM: After triggering its ability and summoning a clone, the clone can now trigger its ability on the same turn independently of the first card.\nBaby Noob: After triggering its ability and summoning a clone, the clone can now trigger its ability on the same turn independently of the first card.\nVicious Bee: After triggering its ability and summoning a clone, the clone can now trigger its ability on the same turn independently of the first card.\nGolf Ball: Rather than its effect, is now Terrified instead.\nJadeFlames: Rather than healing per trigger, now has Regenerating.\n"
