Bandit: end step trigger now triggers on attack instead.\nRageborne Patron: Now only searches for Red or Green Ragebornes (from any colour)\nLiving World: Now has fading.\n2hex: Now also gives a moonleak when cast.\nWill to Survive: Now gives the cards it summons Fading.\nUnited Front: Now ⚪⚪🔴🔴🔴🟢🟢🟢 (+⚪). Now gives the cards it summons Fading.\nHarrison Powell: Now 300/500 (-200/0)\nReckless Recruiter: Effect now gives 50 Power (From 100)\nEmpty Office: Now only triggers on the first cast each turn (from first or second cast each turn)\nToy Train: Now only triggers twice each turn.\nDinosaur of Xargasdon: Now rank 7. Now 600/600 (+100/+100)\nOne4utwo4me: Now 🔴🔴🔴 800/300 (-⚪⚪, -200/-0)\nzPikmon: Now gains 100 Power (from 150)\ndestruction5033: Now gives 100 depower (from 150)\nProfane Bargain: Now rank 6. Now gives 6 cards (from 4)\nEye of Heaven: Now 40🔴 (+🔴🔴🔴🔴)\nClosing Act: Now deals 700 damage (from 1000)\n\t\nChanges to rainbow stud bases:\nCircle Stud: Reworked. Now ⚪⚪. Effect now \"Draw a card. Select a card in your hand. It becomes Red. Select a card in your hand in your hand. It becomes Green. Select a card in your hand. It becomes Blue. Select a card in your hand. It becomes Yellow. Remove all inertia from all cards selected this way.\"\nNascent Stud: A new token. A free black action with the effect \"Stealth. Inert in all zones. Select a colour. Gain a stud of that colour.\"\nRavenshield: Reworked. Now 🔵🟡 800/0. Effect now \"During your end step: Give yourself a Nascent Stud, except it's fleeting. Then draw a card if there's four or more colours among cards in your baseplate.\"\nRoxapox: Now 500/300 🟡🟡. Paint tokens are now free to cast, but prevent you casting actions for the rest of the turn.\nGodlySinha: Now 400/200. Effect now \"When this card is cast: Give yourself a Titanic Stud card of a colour not in your baseplate (or any if all colours are present).\"\nTwo by Two, Spirit of Shards: Effect now \"When this card is cast, or during your end step: Give yourself a Nascent Stud.\"\nSinister Snatchings: Now ⚪🟡🟡🟡🟡🟡 (-⚪). Now also gives two Nascent Studs.\nSoybeen: In addition to its effects, also gives a Nascent Stud.\n\t\nChanges to Seancing: \nMost seance cards now require cards to be cast in order to be seanced, and no longer have a total stud cost limit.\nList of changes:\nNecroforensic Researcher: Reworked. Now 🔵🔵🟡 600/300. Effect now \"Whenever you seance a card: Give yourself a choice card, except it's fading.\"\nSpirit Subpoena: Now only seances cards that were cast this game, and has no stud cost limit. Now draws before resolving the rest of its effect.\nMorgue Merchant: Now only seances cards that were cast this game, and has no stud cost limit. Now 350/350 (+50/+50)\nNecroForensics Corporation: Now seances cards in your opponent's yard, rather than your own. Now only seances cards that were cast this game, and has no stud cost limit.\nOrganoid Officer: Now only seances cards that were cast this game, and has no stud cost limit.\nEternal Justice Mk2: Now only seances cards that were cast this game, and has no stud cost limit.\nCorporate Discipline: Effect now \"Select two non-token cards in your opponent's graveyard that each cost 4 or fewer total studs. Put the first one on top of their deck and you seance the second one.\"\nIntrusive Advertising: Reworked. Effect now \"Inert when discarded. When this card is cast, or whenever it attacks: Seance a card in your graveyard that was cast this game. Whenever you cast your fourth card each turn: Recur this card.\nHalogenic Sprayer: Now ⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡 600/200 (-🔵🟡, -100/-500). Now triggers independently of other copies, and only triggers 3 times per turn (from 6). Now rank 5.\n\t\nSyntax Update: Beckoned Masters\t\nVarious minor back-end changes have been made to Beckoned Masters cards to make them up to date.\nMechanically relevant changes:\nWikiwakiwoirier: Now triggers independently of other copies.\nBasic Bee: Now triggers independently of other copies, and only once each turn. Now 450/150 (-0/-50)\nJavierCollin88Poppin: Now triggers up to eight times each turn, instead of requiring 1000 or less life lost.\nArrows of God's Wrath 2: No longer has stealth.\n\nRandom QoL\nSoul Tax: Exchange order is swapped; Now summons from the baseplate, then puts a card in there.\nKohltastrophe, Infurished Chairman: No longer obliterates colourless cards.\nFluzard: Now only buffs allied fighters.\nBread Factory: Now only unlocks allied fighters.\n"
