		Card = "Darius, the Kingmaker",
		["Patch Notes"] = { {
			Text = "\nBargetown is a Blue-Yellow value deck that smuggles cards from your opponent.\nA smuggled card has its studs converted to blue and yellow, letting Bargetown play any card they steal!\n\nThis is a collaboration with ChadtheCreator's After the Flash, a post-apocalyptic roleplaying game on roblox! Check it out!\n\nSmuggling:\nA smuggled card is inert in all zones and has all 🔴 and 🟢 in its cost converted to 🔵 and 🟡, respectively.\n\nList of new cards:\nDevious Doctor\nBlue Common\n⚪⚪⚪ 500/300\nOnce each turn, whenever you discard a Bargetown card: Give yourself a smuggled fighter card that costs 2 total studs.\n\nCoalition Smuggler\nYellow Common\n⚪⚪ 250/250\nWhen this card is cast: Obliterate the bottom card of your opponent's deck. Give yourself a smuggled copy of it.\n\nBargetown Barista\nYellow Uncommon\n⚪🟡 400/200\nOnce each turn, whenever you cast or discard a smuggled card: Give yourself a Bargetown card.\n\nGuns N' Ammo Shopkeep\nYellow Uncommon\n🔵🟡🟡🟡 600/400\nWhenever an effect gives you a card: This card gains 50 health. \nWhenever you cast a smuggled card: All allied Bargetown fighters gain 150 power.\n\nCorruption\nBlue Uncommon\n⚪🔵🔵🔵🟡 Action\nA target fighter loses 350 power. \nGive yourself a 350/350 Wasteland Mercenary, a free blue fighter with no abilities. It's inert in all zones.\nWhenever you cast a smuggled card: Recur this card, except it's fading.\n\nBargetown Backrooms\nBlue Rare\n⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡 Terrain\nDuring your end step, if you control a Bargetown fighter: Give yourself a smuggled action card that costs 6 or fewer total studs, except it's fleeting.\n\nTroop in the Gane\nBlue Rare\n⚪⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡 650/350\nOnce each turn, whenever an effect gives you a card: Summon a 350/350 Wasteland Mercenary.\n\nPre-War Technology\nYellow Rare \n🔵🔵🟡🟡 Action\nAll enemy fighters lose 100 power. \nGive yourself 2 smuggled fighter cards that each cost 6 total studs.\n\nBulwark Ben\nBlue Epic\n⚪⚪🔵🟡 500/500\nThis card can't attack.\nWhenever you cast a smuggled card: This card can attack this turn. \nWhen this card is cast: Look at the top 6 cards of your opponent's deck and select 1 of them. Obliterate that card. Give yourself a smuggled copy of it.\n\nBargetowner Overboard\nBlue Epic\n⚪⚪⚪⚪⚪⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡 Action\nReturn 2 target fighters to their hand. \nWhenever an effect gives you a card, if this card is in your hand: Remove a colourless stud from this card's cost.\n\nDarius, the Kingmaker\nYellow Legendary\n⚪⚪🔵🔵🟡🟡🟡🟡 450/450\nWhen this card is cast: Give yourself 3 choices. If you've cast 6 or more smuggled cards this game, you may choose all of them.\n🅐 Obliterate the bottom 3 cards of your opponent's deck. Give yourself smuggled copies of them. \n🅑 All allied bargetown fighters gain 250 health and power. \n🅒 You gain BBBYYY.\n\nUse the code JAWSLUGS for some goodies!\n"
		} }
