		["Patch Notes"] = { {
			Text = "\t\tThanks to our christmas sale, 23 people have kept the lights on by becoming cards in BLOX CARDS! You can find them in Hallow's Bargain Bin!\n\t\t\n\t\tList of new cards:\n\t\t\nBig Game Hunting\nRed Epic\n{W}{B} Action\nShuffle a 1500/1500 Bounty into your deck and a 500/500 Huntress into your opponent's deck.\n(The huntress obliterates the bounty regardless of where it is.)\n\nJunozy\nRed Rare\n7{R} 700/700\nWhen this card is cast: Gild 2 target fighters.\nWhen this card dies: Deal 700 damage to all gilded fighters and they gain 700 power.\n(After a gilded fighter attacks another, it becomes gilded.)\n\nChaos Lord's Throne\nColourless Uncommon\n{W}{W}{G}{B}{Y} Terrain\nWhenever you cast a Chair card: Put a Chaotic Blessing on a card space in your hand.\nhenever an allied card uses up a blessing: All allied fighters gain 100 health. All allied Chairs gain 50 power.\n(Chaotic Blessings turn fighters cast from there into Chairs.)\n\nBuilderNoob_s\nYellow Common\n6{Y} 600/600\nDuring your end step: Each player draws a card and reveals the newest card in their hand. They lose 100 life for each stud in its cost.\nWhenever an allied fighter dies, if you've lost life this turn: Select a card from the bottom 5 of your deck. Put that card on top and shuffle the rest back in.\n\nVelleda Lapet\nColourless Legendary\n7{W} 700/700\nRank 10.\nDextrous.\nThis card can't be counterattacked.\nWhenever this card attacks: Draw a card and reveal the newest card in your hand. This card gains 50 power for each stud in its cost.\n\nStrayZe\nGreen Uncommon\n{G}{G}{G} 300/300\nWhen this card is cast: Give yourself 2 150/150 Friendgroups.\n\nSoulysm\nRed Epic\n{W}{W}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R} 800/800\nWhen this card is cast: Mark a target enemy fighter.\nWhenever an enemy fighter dies, if it's marked: Your opponent loses 450 life.\n\nHumorous\nColourless Rare\n{W}{W}{W}{W} 400/400\nThis card has haste if you control another Colourless fighter.\nWhenever this card destroys another: A target allied fighter gains 200 health. If it's Colourless, lock it for 1 turn and it gains 200 power.\n\nDimensional Breakpoint R\nGreen Rare\n{W}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G} Terrain\nOnce each turn, whenever an effect gives you a card: Give yourself an alternate-art card, except it's Green. Convert all {R}{B}{Y} in its cost into {G}.\n\nHoly Guacamole\nBlue Rare\n{B}{B}{B}{Y}{Y} 1000/100\nWhen this card attacks: Select a fighter card in your hand that costs 6 or fewer total studs. Set its stats to 200/200 and its cost to {W}{B}{Y}.\n\nMetroid07\nBlue Legendary\n{B}{B}{B}{B}{W} 800/300\nWhenever this card attacks, if you control a terrain: Destroy it. Draw 3 cards.\n\nADeadBody14\nYellow Rare\n{Y}{Y}{Y}{W} 600/200\nWhenever you discard a card: Select a card in your opponent's graveyard and obliterate it. Shuffle a copy of this card into your deck with that card's stats, passives, and abilities and it has haste. Convert all {R}{G}{B} in its cost to {Y}.\n\nGrim Reaper\nYellow Epic\n{Y}{Y}{Y} 600/600\nWhen this card is cast or after it attacks: Ransack 4. If you don't, destroy this card.\nDuring your end step, if this card is the only one in your graveyard: Recur it.\n\nFalltzen\nYellow Legendary\n{W}{R}{R}{R}{Y}{Y}{Y} 2000/0\n0 Charges.\nWhenever an action targets: You lose 300 life and give yourself a money stack. If it targeted an allied fighter, this card gains a charge, otherwise it loses one. Then if this card has 3 or negative 3 charges on it, it gains 300 power and transcends.\n\nStrat Scion\nRed Legendary\n{W}{W}{R}{R}{Y}{Y}\nWhenever a card leaves your baseplate: Recur this card.\n\nG_RE\n{W}{W}{Y} 700/100\nOnce each turn, whenever you discard a card: Mark a target fighter.\nWhenever this card destroys a marked fighter: Summon an unlocked copy of that fighter, except it's terrified.\n\nKittelens\nRed Epic\n{W}{W}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R} 800/400\n0 Charges.\nDuring your end step: Gain a charge and Summon a 100/100 red Horse Sidekick with overload. For each charge this card has, double that Horse's health and power.\n\nHelliura\nGreen Epic\n{W}{W}{W} 400/400\nDuring your end step, if this card's in your hand and cost fewer than 10 total studs: Add {G} to its cost. It gains 50 health and power for each {G} in its cost.\nWhen this card is cast: You gain life equal to its power and your opponent loses that much life.\n\nFewchsia; Pride\nColourless Epic\n{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}{G}{G}{W} 1750/750\nWhenever this card attacks or an enemy effect targets it: Move 2 non-token cards from your baseplate into your hand. Put a Red Stud and a Green stud in there.\n\nOfficeSpace, Pits Fanatic\nRed Common\n{W}{W}{W}{W} 450/450\nWhen this card dies: You lose 450 life. Give yourself 3 100/0 Cheering Demons with no abilities, except they're fading and inert in all zones.\n\nCriollo, Echo Knight\nBlue Rare\n{W}{B}{B}{B}{B}{B}{B} 450/450\nWhen this card is cast: Reset a target fighter's stats. Summon a blue Echo with defender. Its stats are equal to the health and power the resetted card lost or gained this way.\n\nHyliehaven - Red Dominance\nRed Uncommon\n{R}{R} 350/350\nWhen this card is cast, or whenever you discard a card: put a Horrific Blessing onto a card space in your hand.\nWhen this card dies, if you have 3 or more blessings: You gain {W}{G}{B}{Y}.\n(Horrific Blessings give the next fighter cast there 100 power and overload.)\n\nHyliehaven - Blue Logic\nBlue Uncommon\n{B}{B} 350/350\nWhen this card is cast: Put a Humble Blessing on a card in your hand.\nWhen this card dies, if you control a locked fighter: You gain {W}{R}{G}{Y}.\n(Humble Blessings give the next fighter cast there 150 health and an additional lock.)\n\n\n"
